<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive">
  <title>Link vencido — CEVICO</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Inter, Roboto, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px;
      color: #1a2333; background: #f4f7fc radial-gradient(1100px 420px at 50% -180px, rgb(37 99 235 / 0.18), rgb(37 99 235 / 0) 70%) no-repeat;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 440px; width: 100%; text-align: center; padding: 40px 32px; border-radius: 24px;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,.9), rgba(255,255,255,.7));
      border: 1px solid rgb(37 99 235 / 0.22); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 #fff, 0 12px 32px -14px rgb(30 64 175 / 0.3);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4b5870; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <h1>Este link venceu</h1>
    <p>O link de leitura desta análise não vale mais. Peça um link novo para quem compartilhou com você.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
